OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after being hit by car
OL,4,
OL,5,FA pedestrian has died after being hit
OL,6,Fby a car in Darley Dale.
OL,8,FDerbyshire Police said they received
OL,9,Freports a man was hit by a vehicle
OL,10,Ftravelling along Station Road at about
OL,11,F18:00 GMT on Friday.
OL,13,FThe force said Romek Gackowski, 75, of
OL,14,FPainters Way in Two Dales near Matlock,
OL,15,Fdied at the scene. His family are being
OL,16,Fsupported by specially trained
OL,17,Fofficers.
OL,19,FInvestigating officers have urged
OL,20,Fpotential witnesses or anyone driving
OL,21,Fin the area with dashcam footage at the
OL,22,Ftime to come forward.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
